# GitHub reads this file on every PR and requests review from the last
# pattern that matches each changed file. It becomes a hard requirement
# only when we turn on branch protection for `main` (Settings → Branches)
# with "Require review from Code Owners". Until then it simply documents
# who owns what, and powers the repo's Code owners page.
#
# Syntax reference (last matching pattern wins):
# https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
